you wear this for any amount of time

00:04:46.199 --> 00:04:51.030
because it's not made for keeping stuff
stuck, the glitter is probably going to

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:56.160
migrate. So sticking glitter near your
eye in something that's not made for

00:04:56.160 --> 00:05:01.680
